WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Welcome. Let's start with why cash flow matters.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Profit and cash are not the same thing.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
A sale on paper is not money in the bank.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Customers often pay 30 to 60 days later.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
But rent, payroll and HST are due on fixed dates.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
A forecast gives you time to act before a short week.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
It gives you a clear number to show your bank.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
And it makes hiring and buying decisions calmer.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Next, we'll sort your cash into money coming in and money going out.
